  "details": "For some reason, there is a decent chunk of people that will be able to see a video being played, but have no audio. With the new patch that came out adding the automated video player updater, I somehow now have even more friends that are unable to hear audio on videos played on VRC_SyncVideoStream players, which are the ones that have fast forward and rewind buttons.\nI have tried this using multiple platforms too for hosting videos. YouTube, Google Drive, Dropbox, there's always people who are somehow unable to hear the audio being played",
